flowchart TD
  A[Verified Artist subset + Designer coverage] --> B[Final mapping before code]
  B --> C[Preloaded fixed texture resources]
  D[Existing state and redraw events] --> E[Draw only actual opening/world]
  C --> E
  E --> F[One/batched ground texture path]
  E --> G[Existing player and Supply Table]
  E --> H[Existing placement preview/state]
  E --> I[Existing exact known entities only]
  F --> J[Preserve geometry + overlays + fallback]
  G --> J
  H --> J
  I --> J
  J --> K[Root bounded remote actual-build capture]
  K --> L[C inspects real opening screenshots]
  L --> M[Concrete fixes then final exact-build handoff]
  N[Already-projected Person] --> O[Assignment/rear place + held STOCK direct lookup]
  O --> I
  P[Already-selected build kind] --> Q[Separate visual_kind only]
  Q --> H
